        "book": "Genesis",
        "chapter": 31,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "And he said, Lift up now thine eyes, and see, all the rams which leap upon the cattle are ringstraked, speckled, and grisled: for I have seen all that Laban doeth unto thee.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
