        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Genesis 31:14",
        "book": "Genesis",
        "chapter": 31,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "Are we not counted of him strangers? for he hath sold us, and hath quite devoured also our money.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Genesis 31:15",
        "book": "Genesis",
        "chapter": 31,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "For all the riches which God hath taken from our father, that is ours, and our children’s: now then, whatsoever God hath said unto thee, do.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 62,
            "end": 64
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Genesis 31:16",
        "book": "Genesis",
        "chapter": 31,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "Then Jacob rose up, and set his sons and his wives upon camels;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Genesis 31:17",
        "book": "Genesis",
        "chapter": 31,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "And he carried away all his cattle, and all his goods which he had gotten, the cattle of his getting, which he had gotten in Padan-aram, for to go to Isaac his father in the land of Canaan.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Genesis 31:18",
        "book": "Genesis",
        "chapter": 31,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
